# sweep: --bare --seed-root examples/audiobook/fixtures/keys
# The three keys are seeded as fake owner-wide files, so Create reaches the
# estimate. Nothing is spent: the route stops at the estimate and goes back.
wait-for Audiobooks
tap Create
wait-for Your topic
tap Type any topic
type the moon
tap-id kb.enter
wait-for Before you start
expect 3 to 8 minutes
expect $1 to $5
expect 7 to 11 thousand ElevenLabs characters
expect One Exa research run and one OpenAI script
expect An estimate, billed to your own accounts
expect Create audiobook
expect-missing Add your keys
clean
shot audiobook-estimate
tap Edit topic
wait-for Your topic
expect the moon
